# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/octo-2 four-card DEVELOPMENT window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/octo-2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo2-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-octo2-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# OGA (LEVER 2, EXACTNESS, LEAN): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo-glue8-audit = the audited octo twin plus QWEN_FAST_OCTO_GLUE8=1, so QWEN_FAST_TP4_VGLUE_AUDIT compares every native split, merge and block-conv entry of the octo block with the served path in the trace,
# on every chip, and the verify T1 and T2 audits run on both shapes. Two tests only (warmup, concurrent8_steady: nine requests): an audited 8x262k request costs about 8.4 minutes. READ in this order and stop at the first failure:
# (1) the attach: '[OCTO] admitted mode=alternate ...' once, no '[OCTO] refused', no program compiled after the attach; (2) c2_smoke_check clean, whose octo rule includes octo_glue8.glue8_problems (an engaged line per native
# site at users=8 rows=8, 48 of 48 GDN layers in the octo block's capture, no 'fell back', no '[PINDIAG] tp4 vglue octo 8-row served path' at a native site) and the vglue audit lines (tp4_vglue.AUDIT_MARKER 'exact=True'
# for the octo block's pieces, merged outputs and block conv entries; AUDIT_MISMATCH fails it). This settles the canonical set at eight rows (users 0 and 4 raw, 1 2 3 5 6 7 canonical, an extension of the sixteen-row rule
# by position) and that a row's conv-gates result does not depend on its tile row or quarter. A mismatch is NO-GO for the lever. Duration (estimate): 90 minutes (nine audited requests at 8.4 minutes, plus a boot).
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo2-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo-glue8-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady
